{"kp_id": "shl-003.kp0001", "video_id": "shl-003", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "太阳病恶寒发热本当汗解；未得汗剂而吐，或吐后饥而不能食，为胃气未复。", "entity_ids": ["syndrome.tai_yang_bing", "method.fa_han"], "chapter_id": "shl-003.c01", "evidence_quote": "本来我们要汗汗剂，用麻麻当或桂子裆葛根汤都可以发汗", "seg_from": 4, "seg_to": 12, "start_s": 35.58, "end_s": 107.555, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sXeC_aoJtKE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sXeC_aoJtKE&t=35s", "series": "shl", "episode": 3, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 3太陽症（下）", "start_s": 35.58, "end_s": 107.56}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "麻麻当=麻黄汤；桂子裆=桂枝汤", "source": "llm_read"}
