{"kp_id": "shl-003.kp0041", "video_id": "shl-003", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "第163条：外证未除数下之，协热下利、心下痞硬、表里不解，桂枝人参汤（理中加桂枝）。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.163", "formula.gui_zhi_ren_shen_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-003.c18", "evidence_quote": "外症未除，而术下之随邪热，下力还有力，下附子心下脾，便表里不节者，桂枝人参汤", "seg_from": 3129, "seg_to": 3151, "start_s": 17574.653, "end_s": 17677.823, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sXeC_aoJtKE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sXeC_aoJtKE&t=17574s", "series": "shl", "episode": 3, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 3太陽症（下）", "start_s": 17574.65, "end_s": 17677.82}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "术下=数下；脾=痞", "source": "llm_read"}
