{"kp_id": "shl-003.kp0043", "video_id": "shl-003", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "吐下后七八日不解、热结在里、表里俱热、汗出恶风、大渴舌燥，白虎汤证。", "entity_ids": ["formula.bai_hu_tang", "clause.shl.168"], "chapter_id": "shl-003.c19", "evidence_quote": "表里具热食汗恶风，大口而反折，上干燥", "seg_from": 3376, "seg_to": 3403, "start_s": 18956.509, "end_s": 19093.534, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sXeC_aoJtKE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sXeC_aoJtKE&t=18956s", "series": "shl", "episode": 3, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 3太陽症（下）", "start_s": 18956.51, "end_s": 19093.53}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "大口=大渴；反折=舌", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-003.kp0044", "video_id": "shl-003", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "白虎汤重用石膏，粳米调和；石膏须布包煎。有表证时勿独用白虎，可与桂枝合方表里双解。", "entity_ids": ["formula.bai_hu_tang", "herb.shi_gao"], "chapter_id": "shl-003.c19", "evidence_quote": "因为是白虎，所以我们就石膏石膏要重用", "seg_from": 3427, "seg_to": 3509, "start_s": 19208.609, "end_s": 19716.159, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sXeC_aoJtKE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sXeC_aoJtKE&t=19208s", "series": "shl", "episode": 3, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 3太陽症（下）", "start_s": 19208.61, "end_s": 19716.16}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-003.kp0045", "video_id": "shl-003", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "白虎证核心是燥渴壮热：血糖高低、冷汗发抖等凡见此象皆可思白虎/加人参；无表证渴欲饮水用白虎加人参。", "entity_ids": ["formula.bai_hu_jia_ren_shen_tang", "formula.bai_hu_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-003.c19", "evidence_quote": "渴欲饮水，无表症者，白虎加人参汤", "seg_from": 3441, "seg_to": 3494, "start_s": 19283.609, "end_s": 19645.444, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sXeC_aoJtKE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sXeC_aoJtKE&t=19283s", "series": "shl", "episode": 3, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 3太陽症（下）", "start_s": 19283.61, "end_s": 19645.44}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
