{"kp_id": "shl-003.kp0047", "video_id": "shl-003", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "第174条：伤寒八九日风湿相搏、身体疼烦不能转侧、脉浮虚而涩，桂枝附子汤；大便硬小便自利者去桂加白术。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.174", "formula.gui_zhi_fu_zi_tang", "formula.bai_zhu_fu_zi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-003.c21", "evidence_quote": "涩就是湿的一个脉，就是桂枝附子汤主之若其人大便堂小便治理的桂枝附子去桂枝加白术汤", "seg_from": 3708, "seg_to": 3712, "start_s": 20799.228, "end_s": 20841.808, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sXeC_aoJtKE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sXeC_aoJtKE&t=20799s", "series": "shl", "episode": 3, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 3太陽症（下）", "start_s": 20799.23, "end_s": 20841.81}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "大便堂=大便硬；治理=自利", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-003.kp0048", "video_id": "shl-003", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "桂枝附子汤：桂枝汤去芍药加炮附子；风湿游走痛重用炮附。白术附子则去桂加术，湿偏内停。", "entity_ids": ["formula.gui_zhi_fu_zi_tang", "herb.fu_zi", "herb.bai_zhu"], "chapter_id": "shl-003.c21", "evidence_quote": "他少了一个白勺，没有把白烧拿掉，变成这个泡附子，就是桂枝附子汤", "seg_from": 3715, "seg_to": 3817, "start_s": 20848.648, "end_s": 21487.233, "citation": {"youtube_id": "sXeC_aoJtKE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sXeC_aoJtKE&t=20848s", "series": "shl", "episode": 3, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 3太陽症（下）", "start_s": 20848.65, "end_s": 21487.23}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "白勺/白烧=白芍", "source": "llm_read"}
